{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "508a5e17f6f98e33818abacf4f68cdef9e370b7315e0527b55486767b39a960c", "ja": "{$P$}！　大変なの～！\nミキ、すっごい秘密を知っちゃった！", "zh": "{$P$}！不得了啦～！\n美希发现了一个天大的秘密！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "c44d7757b58831e65c9dd5418da8896e7e543ebe125081141767b0021ced2b56", "ja": "あのね、甘酒って、おにぎりだったの！\nシャケとおかか、どっちがいいと思う？", "zh": "我跟你说哦，甜酒其实是饭团！\n你觉得三文鱼和木鱼花，哪个比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "973334c1c265500a5b38f1cc85fff361e71ca77b1257aec0430bc319f3a83467", "ja": "待て、落ち着いてくれ美希。\nとりあえず……順番に話してくれないかな？", "zh": "等等，冷静一下，美希。\n总之……能不能按顺序跟我说说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "dcec7f849987d6648d65ad9c5d5091ccee7965bde36ee9fe1026a7b9bbcd72de", "ja": "え？　あ、そっか！　じゃあ、順番に話すね。\nあのね、甘酒って、お米からできてるんだって！", "zh": "诶？啊，对哦！那我就按顺序说啦。\n那个，听说甘酒是用米做的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "96d5ab277e356d1f03f1c38c6e99581c33b97c07cea43dae9b6c975acfea7aa2", "ja": "だから甘酒は、おにぎりの親戚！\n……ね、びっくりした？", "zh": "所以甘酒是饭团的亲戚！\n……怎么样，很惊讶吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "90ed922f01a7a65181a38e0d39feac8605388c002ce939eb67c970c25aed27fd", "ja": "ああ、たしかそうだったと思うよ。\nノンアルコールで滋養たっぷりだ。", "zh": "啊，我记得好像确实是这样。\n不含酒精，而且营养丰富。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc3e8ea956dd6700674121390cfbba38347b7aaa0c96fec88a110c9159042abb", "ja": "え～？　{$P$}、びっくりしないの？\nミキ的には、大発見ってカンジだったのに～！！", "zh": "诶～？{$P$}，你都不惊讶的吗？\n对美希来说，这可是重大发现的感觉呢～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bf66cb6ccaacd9235fdbb3ebfdc6317c7ae4f244ba33aa247ceda2ae0dc9142b", "ja": "ごめん、なんかガッカリさせちゃったみたいで。\n美希は誰に教えてもらったんだ？", "zh": "抱歉，好像让你失望了。美希是听谁告诉你的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0dd2e924916ff5f6f463c3bfa342b5986a0da5a9a140f6c699253421f6d8f74", "ja": "お参りに行った時、甘酒もらったでしょ？　あの時の\n屋台のおじさんに、神社でまた会っちゃったの。", "zh": "我们去参拜的时候，你拿到过甘酒吧？就是那时候的\n摊位大叔，我又在神社碰到他了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1009_p", "source_sha256": "52072f590a78a0552bfbdd5d68cf799cbdc3af01f158fad0cac62cc1c9f6302f", "ja": "そうか。一応言っておくけど、神社は昼寝を\nしに行く所じゃないからな。……それで？", "zh": "这样啊。先说一句，神社可不是去午睡的地方。……然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "70b4c6960f0190eb2945685ea21a913e9ab1dc4045fdccea07b4ca292440c619", "ja": "うん、そしたらね、甘酒の作り方を教えてくれたの。\n炊飯器で作れるよ～って。", "zh": "嗯，然后啊，她教了我甜酒的做法。\n说是用电饭煲就能做哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4a7627d66f9afcdf0d4572d9ce2975b13e72c39f7ff260e93ebe3c2632abd073", "ja": "えっ、炊飯器で？　そうだったのか？", "zh": "诶，用电饭煲就能做？原来是这样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "e6b62f1af470c3ab69a9e3b466a87af4dc5596496e331bde06c7101ce63c8117", "ja": "あっ、やっぱり{$P$}も驚いたの！\nあはっ、よかった☆", "zh": "啊，果然连{$P$}也吓了一跳！\n啊哈，太好了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "9e179fa358848777d62e75b9f45cb0e8f9afa7adb2d8043b4ca229ef4a45cd57", "ja": "でねでね、おかゆからでも、甘酒はできるんだって！\nってことは、おにぎりも甘酒にできるよね♪", "zh": "对了对了，听说就算用粥也能做成甘酒呢！\n这么说来，饭团也能做成甘酒吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "b6f5d1285de56f335a7ccbf06d70fca4ca8c1652ba3cbb358b6e4c5cc1619ff7", "ja": "シャケとかおかかとか、トッピングと一緒に甘酒に\nできたらカワイイし、絶対おいしいって思うな♪", "zh": "要是能把鲑鱼、木鱼碎之类的和配料一起做成甘酒，一定很可爱，而且肯定很好吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f579ae67fd0303dc239802a90bfe562aef89571a03cf8cf6451635c8b6b3d09d", "ja": "カワイイ……かな？　ジャムやヨーグルトを\n入れるのは、聞いたことがあるけど……。", "zh": "可爱……吗？我听说过往里面加果酱或酸奶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "3cd6e4fab8505c38a5146fc3a09b4a0a20d9ffe8d6d7924beccfa23e65aad250", "ja": "おにぎり甘酒、今度作ってみるね！\nできあがったら、一緒に味見しようね♪", "zh": "饭团甜酒，我下次试着做做看！\n做好之后，我们一起尝尝看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "11ed67b1f88d5690daa98054911782866c91b10cda56572a98a872760fff8801", "ja": "……え？　ミキの手料理、イヤ？", "zh": "……诶？美希亲手做的饭菜，你不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1019_p", "source_sha256": "019f20e47457aaa001f2382c1d1cded9a8e090a9e9b180ffe3b8407381436569", "ja": "いやじゃないが。……いやじゃないが、それを\n美希の手料理といっていいのかが問題というか……", "zh": "倒不是讨厌。……倒不是讨厌，只是问题在于\n那到底能不能算作美希亲手做的料理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc08210482602c09e2d5d3cb6fe5f08d249f956b0ff4dc3d1ba6811af86dbc34", "ja": "よかった♪　ミキ、ちゃんと手で作るから大丈夫なの！\nそれじゃ、今度いっぱい作ってくるね。待っててね☆", "zh": "太好了♪　美希会好好亲手做的，所以没问题啦！\n那就改天做很多带过来哦。等着我哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0153_1021_p", "source_sha256": "da3b438d55895f9e0a04127ed3a12287a9471f58496cd25c4fa85f1e22214b2b", "ja": "ああっ、待ってくれ美希！　せめて少しずつ、\n1個ずつ作ってみるとか……美希ー！", "zh": "啊，等一下，美希！至少试试每次做1个，少量多次地做……美希——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
